Step 1: Download the latest UE4SS expiremental release from https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS/releases/tag/experimental-latest
Step 2: Download the UE4SS S.T.A.L.K.E.R 2 compatability from https://www.nexusmods.com/stalker2heartofchornobyl/mods/2341
step 3: in the comments of the compatability should be the fix for 2.0.5
Step 4: Go into UE4SS settings and change/add them to this:
bUseUObjectArrayCache = false
DefaultFNameToStringMethod = Conv_NameToString

HookInitGameState = 0
HookLoadMap = 0
HookCallFunctionByNameWithArguments = 0
HookBeginPlay = 0
HookLocalPlayerExec = 0
HookAActorTick = 0
HookEngineTick = 0
HookLoadMap = 0
HookGameViewportClientTick = 0

Step 5: Add the AP bridge into the Mods folder under UE4SS
Step 6: in Mods.txt add a line: STALKER2_AP_Bridge : 1
Step 7: in client folder run BUILT_BAT
Step 8: Configure AP world 
Step 9: Open S.T.A.L.K.E.R 2
Step 10: Open the client and connect
Step 11: start a new game
